#
# Commissioning artefacts are produced in this directory by the tools that live here, and
# they are MEASUREMENTS OF ONE ROBOT. Committing one would put a number describing LITE3-A
# in front of the next person measuring LITE3-B, which is the single thing issue #13 asks
# us not to do. Attach them to the issue instead.
lite3-*.json
lite3-*.jsonl
lite3_front_camera_*.json
